{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-roudah","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"roudah-expo-city-expo-valley-views","about":"Roudah Dubai is a 9-floor residential building within Expo Valley Views, a master-planned community in the heart of Expo City Dubai. These Expo City Dubai residences offer a flexible mix of 1, 2 and 3-bedroom apartments designed around generous floor plans, private balconies, and refined interior palettes.Prices start from AED 1.69M, supported by a 1-year post-handover payment plan. Roudah Expo City master plan draws its design language from the natural contours of the land with podiums, terraces, and courtyards that flow into the landscape. Interiors come in two refined palettes, Timeless Elegance and Calm Canvas, each crafted to bring warmth, light, and balance into everyday living.Residents of Roudah at Expo City enjoy a two-level amenity ecosystem spanning the ground floor and podium, including multiple swimming pools, gyms, kids' clubs, yoga decks, a community plaza, and outdoor dining areas. Backed by Expo City Dubai's sustainability principles, Roudah integrates native planting, smart irrigation, and water reuse systems aligned with the UAE's Net Zero 2050 vision.","price":1690000,"title":"Roudah","bitrix":{"id":1510,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":null,"tower_name":null,"campaign_name":" Roudah","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Expo City","project_location":"Expo Valley Views"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/Feature_55cdd97a5f.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/Feature_55cdd97a5f.webp"}],"status":null,"_geoloc":{"lat":24.962474003257,"lng":55.164611007679},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/Gallery_10_ff2bf2cebf.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/Gallery_10_ff2bf2cebf.webp"},{"